{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"lisp","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Lisp and Scheme","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Lisp and Scheme (.lisp .lsp .cl .el).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"lisp","name":"Lisp and Scheme","extensions":[".lisp",".lsp",".cl",".el"],"grammar":"grammars/lisp.json","lineComment":";","blockComment":["#|","|#"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Lisp and Scheme","path":"snippets/lisp.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/lisp.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"#\\\\|\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\|#\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \";.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \":[A-Za-z0-9_\\\\-]+|'[A-Za-z0-9_\\\\-]+\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[()]\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:define-syntax|defparameter|defgeneric|quasiquote|defstruct|defmethod|defmacro|defclass|dotimes|require|provide|defvar|define|lambda|letrec|unless|dolist|module|defun|progn|quote|begin|let\\\\*|cond|case|when|loop|setq|setf|let|and|not|if|do|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:else|nil|#t|#f|t)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:reverse|funcall|display|newline|append|length|filter|reduce|format|mapcar|member|apply|print|assoc|equal|cons|list|car|cdr|map|eql|eq)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/lisp.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function (Common Lisp)\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"defun\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(defun ${1:name} (${2:args})\",\n      \"  $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Define (Scheme)\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"def\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(define (${1:name} ${2:args})\",\n      \"  $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A definition\"\n  },\n  \"Let\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"let\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(let ((${1:x} ${2:1}))\",\n      \"  $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"let bindings\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Lisp and Scheme\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Lisp and Scheme.\n\n## Files\n\n`.lisp`, `.lsp`, `.cl`, `.el`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `;`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `defun` | A function |\n| `def` | A definition |\n| `let` | let bindings |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}